# 23. Persian, RTL and Technical-Value Rules

Every worked-on surface must verify:

- English LTR
- Persian RTL
- Canonical Persian font
- Mixed-direction technical values
- API keys and IDs remain readable LTR
- Numbers remain readable
- Dates and times remain understandable
- Symbols and asset pairs remain readable
- No raw i18n keys
- No English leakage where translation is expected

Portal-rendered UI must explicitly inherit language, direction and typography
when necessary.

